{"3852910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DuskGate", "steam_appid": 3852910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown gate suddenly opened—and from it poured alien creatures that have seized control of the cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is consumed by chaos and fear. You are the final hope of humanity, the one who must reclaim the occupied zones and shut down the gate before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/f0e32c1b19879c2c082d38afd7a175d4.poster.avif?t=1781103245\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/f0e32c1b19879c2c082d38afd7a175d4.webm?t=1781103245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/f0e32c1b19879c2c082d38afd7a175d4.mp4?t=1781103245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reclaim the city, one zone at a time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area is filled with different enemies and threats. Hunt them down across the city, fight through dynamic battlefields, and take back the zones one by one. Explore immersive map designs and engage enemies in your own unique way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stylish action, satisfying impact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced, exhilarating hack-and-slash combat. Cut through waves of enemies with stylish combos and explosive impact. Relentless speed and visceral attacks make every moment thrilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/d2982d190a20e2fb48bd683d9a3282ee.poster.avif?t=1781103245\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/d2982d190a20e2fb48bd683d9a3282ee.webm?t=1781103245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/d2982d190a20e2fb48bd683d9a3282ee.mp4?t=1781103245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss fights that demand strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses are unforgiving. Learn their patterns, find openings, and strike with precision. One mistake can be fatal—caution and timing are your greatest weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/17754dfd928cfcbb6cacf5f950492bd4.poster.avif?t=1781103245\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/17754dfd928cfcbb6cacf5f950492bd4.webm?t=1781103245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/17754dfd928cfcbb6cacf5f950492bd4.mp4?t=1781103245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>You are humanity’s final warrior</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who crave stylish combat, powerful feedback, and the thrill of overwhelming odds—this is your battlefield. Step in, fight hard, and become the last hope of Earth.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown gate suddenly opened—and from it poured alien creatures that have seized control of the cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is consumed by chaos and fear. You are the final hope of humanity, the one who must reclaim the occupied zones and shut down the gate before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/f0e32c1b19879c2c082d38afd7a175d4.poster.avif?t=1781103245\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/f0e32c1b19879c2c082d38afd7a175d4.webm?t=1781103245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/f0e32c1b19879c2c082d38afd7a175d4.mp4?t=1781103245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reclaim the city, one zone at a time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area is filled with different enemies and threats. Hunt them down across the city, fight through dynamic battlefields, and take back the zones one by one. Explore immersive map designs and engage enemies in your own unique way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stylish action, satisfying impact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced, exhilarating hack-and-slash combat. Cut through waves of enemies with stylish combos and explosive impact. Relentless speed and visceral attacks make every moment thrilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/d2982d190a20e2fb48bd683d9a3282ee.poster.avif?t=1781103245\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/d2982d190a20e2fb48bd683d9a3282ee.webm?t=1781103245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/d2982d190a20e2fb48bd683d9a3282ee.mp4?t=1781103245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss fights that demand strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses are unforgiving. Learn their patterns, find openings, and strike with precision. One mistake can be fatal—caution and timing are your greatest weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/17754dfd928cfcbb6cacf5f950492bd4.poster.avif?t=1781103245\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/17754dfd928cfcbb6cacf5f950492bd4.webm?t=1781103245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/extras/17754dfd928cfcbb6cacf5f950492bd4.mp4?t=1781103245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>You are humanity’s final warrior</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who crave stylish combat, powerful feedback, and the thrill of overwhelming odds—this is your battlefield. Step in, fight hard, and become the last hope of Earth.</p>", "short_description": "Alien invaders have emerged through a mysterious portal, plunging humanity into despair. In this action RPG blending soulslike difficulty with hack-and-slash speed, you must reclaim strongholds, close the gate, and survive relentless enemies using strategic combos and split-second decisions.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/aedb3c99f499ca5d364542c35b571419fd70d6e4/header.jpg?t=1781103245", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852910/dde2410697a193532